+// Clears |fields|, parses |format|, and adds the format address fields to
+// |fields|. The |fields| may also contain NEWLINE elements. For example, parses
+// "%S%C%n%D%X" into {ADMIN_AREA, LOCALITY, NEWLINE, DEPENDENT_LOCALITY,
