+ * This data represents Table D.2 in the JPEG spec (ISO/IEC IS 10918-1
+ * and CCITT Recommendation ITU-T T.81) and Table 24 in the JBIG spec
+ * (ISO/IEC IS 11544 and CCITT Recommendation ITU-T T.82).
